 "text": "What if you got $1 every time someone said AI? Day 1. A podcast plays in the background. $14. Day 2. You go to one tech meetup. Week 1. Your friends start saying it on purpose. They want to cut. Week 3. Your bank freezes your account. Suspicious activity. Month 2. Earning season. Every CEO says it 80 times per call. Month 6. The tax office has a whole team just for you. Year 1. Companies start saying machine learning just to avoid paying you. Year 3. Three governments try to ban the word. Year 10. You're a billionaire. You still can't explain what AI is. What should pay you next?"
